  "description": "When Addie’s twin sister, Beatrice, falls ill before a presentation that could make or break her career, Addie agrees to impersonate her at work. But what was supposed to be a one-time favor turns into a long-term, high stakes sister swap when the cold, stern CEO likes one of Addie’s ideas. Now the sisters have to keep switching back and forth on the job. But with the CEO starting to fall for Addie and the cute front desk guy in love with Beatrice, can the twin sisters manage to keep up the con without breaking anyone’s hearts?\n\nSource: Tapas",
